    {
      "legacy": "npc/2081004.js",
      "source_sha256": "986a0940c3b47e483a81d6fcdf6f4b3e61b25d61d89bc8945bfa64a4e4050ea0",
      "lua": "npc/2081004.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hmmm... baby formula? Don't you think you're past that age?",
      "lua_sha256": "e6ff2b3407a3b67ccd6c83f5b0368c19c83d141d443f69f08b10e0d5c73c0769"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2111004.js",
      "source_sha256": "aaefea18393dd1fd32214bc6f847f668af584d53978a4fa5bbd295d3d1029b13",
      "lua": "npc/2111004.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "Even though Alchemists and Fairies have antipathy for each other, I can still be in this town because the Zenumist President has been protecting us.",
      "lua_sha256": "87e3ae3f1a9e31d8ce42e23467313d1619b2e9415213e2bdc755b25919e64fc7"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2111005.js",
      "source_sha256": "664ff92147bf8a266b38a9fde1804c0da906a314a757607dee7d23530ba66599",
      "lua": "npc/2111005.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "Almost all Magatian people are Alchemists. Everyone concentrates on Alchemy. So...Magatia is always quiet.",
      "lua_sha256": "ea0d0cd6654620ac46dc1b43124f02ca29405dd21ce5817f3389ed3881d45728"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2111007.js",
      "source_sha256": "9249181f43cff1872f88c956ff121c21d94f6b55ccda769ea6549dd15b021b40",
      "lua": "npc/2111007.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hm... Don't doubt it because I'm a back street broker. Dealing with me is trust... I keep up my credit.",
      "lua_sha256": "4ac277d404c24f69986dd792625e14d9a3db999be1e5d6224a30698f74757d43"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2111008.js",
      "source_sha256": "861ecb632cc9c1fa6127985b22dee366350ed1213d037e8e3d20d6d35c639588",
      "lua": "npc/2111008.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "Make it clear of your position! Are you Zenumist or Alcadno?",
      "lua_sha256": "d070c2a2091f84c930519c473833243749abf5c8e25cc4e8822b6d8377185757"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2111009.js",
      "source_sha256": "42c2eba1c481da9e4f10b9c8703759bee26d50b55a5ad34b5eb79ecc3e584540",
      "lua": "npc/2111009.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "Definitely Alcadno is excluded.....Huhuhuhu.....Stupid people....cannot see the real important things..",
      "lua_sha256": "51a89616f1381ef4b025dfb130cbd50555e2a7f39876ebb3748335cf3076dbf4"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2112012.js",
      "source_sha256": "4885731790bcf51d094fc158714d75c7703fb9d75a40a8271e160355c1e8c104",
      "lua": "npc/2112012.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have been #rremoved#k from the game.",
      "lua_sha256": "5f78da353ed7e07a876fe66f101cf89417dc838cd139f2e44c80857ee6a0e67b"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2131000.js",
      "source_sha256": "c6c545c4e09030b8212a4aa6ca88eff2b44834ef6988b027bb51ca131dc93ac5",
      "lua": "npc/2131000.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "It is been a while since we left Ossyria to avoid the Black Magician. If not for the world tree, I do not know where we would have been. I have been trying to establish myself here, but that is not easy. I wonder how things are like back home.",
      "lua_sha256": "75328987d488d06ae0e63ba91079051a5181f75e7b9519359c6090217188161b"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2131002.js",
      "source_sha256": "67ef3631568e816dce6913f1a5cf4a896a0b35c8f4d654200f169071ae962dc4",
      "lua": "npc/2131002.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "My name is Euryth... As you can see, I am a fairy. People tell me I do not act fairy-like, but... I like making things out of metal objects. Shhh, don't tell this to anyone, but I also like MMA.",
      "lua_sha256": "ea89839b6140f02df3ce92df5705ba2d500bdf6d39d218110268bba639efb159"
    },
    {
      "legacy": "npc/2132000.js",
      "source_sha256": "fbe66b495d1420c26c2d1826a3a9036ecc3c22f8a18ac765e79ea2e42c084183",
      "lua": "npc/2132000.lua",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hmmm! For you to make your way here, far away from the Camp, you must be one strong individual. Let's explore new areas and find a place to establish our own town!!",
      "lua_sha256": "fc2d240b2cd55ed49b89a8c56374c33b7f9ada10bfe8a1677ad58adaa68d02a4"
    },
    {
